
## SEALED ZANPAKUTO --------------------------
Asauchi.name = Asauchi
Asauchi.description = A blank soul template. The foundation for a future Zanpakuto, awaiting the imprint of its owner.
Sealed_Sode_no_Shirayuki.name = Sealed - Sode no Shirayuki
Sealed_Sode_no_Shirayuki.description = A sealed zanpakuto. Its dance has not yet begun.
Sealed_Wabisuke.name = Sealed - Wabisuke
Sealed_Wabisuke.description = A sealed zanpakuto. When you hold into it something presses down your soul.
Sealed_Benihime.name = Sealed - Benihime
Sealed_Benihime.description = A sealed zanpakuto. This blade is waiting for your command.
Sealed_Hozukimaru.name = Sealed - Hozukimaru
Sealed_Hozukimaru.description = A sealed zanpakuto. When you hold it in battle you feel tremendous excitement.
Sealed_Senbonzakura.name = Sealed - Senbonzakura
Sealed_Senbonzakura.description = A sealed zanpakuto. A refined blade with a graceful aura.
Sealed_Zangetsu.name = Sealed – Zangetsu
Sealed_Zangetsu.description = The sealed blade before awakening. Holds boundless, yet dormant potential.
Sealed_Kenpachi_Zanpakuto.name = Sealed – Kenpachi's Zanpakuto
Sealed_Kenpachi_Zanpakuto.description = A massive, crude and rusted cleaver. This is the sealed state of a Zanpakuto belonging to a warrior of monstrous spiritual pressure. Its jagged, unrefined form and tattered wrappings are self-imposed limitations, \
										allowing the wielder to savor the thrill of battle longer. The true power within is dormant, awaiting acknowledgment.\n \
										<color is="#ffffff"><b>Skills:</b></color>\n \
										- Q: Skull Crusher - Cost 75% Signature Energy.\n \
										- E: Battle Trance - Grants extra resistance, x1.5 speed attack, increased movement speed - Cost 100% Signature Energy.\n \
										- Hold Left-Click: AOE Charge Slash.\n \
										- Hold Left-Click + Forward: Thrust.\n \
										- Guard + F: Shunpo - Cost 1.5 Stamina, 10 Reiryoku

## SHIKAI ZANPAKUTO --------------------------
Shikai_Tensa_Zangetsu.name = Shikai – Zangetsu
Shikai_Tensa_Zangetsu.description = Zangetsu is a massive spiritual cleaver, permanently in its released state. The black blade, wrapped in living cloth, empowers its wielder, unleashing <i><b>Getsuga Tensho</b></i> waves and serving as a shield against physical and energy-based attacks.\n \
									<color is="#ffffff"><b>Skills:</b></color>\n \
									- Q: Getsuga Tensho - Cost 100% Signature Energy.\n \
									- Guard + F: Shunpo - Cost 1.5 Stamina, 10 Reiryoku
Sode_No_Shirayuki.name = Shikai – Sode no Shirayuki
Sode_No_Shirayuki.description = An elegant ice katana. Its release command, \n<i><b>«Dance, Sode no Shirayuki»</b></i> commands cold and beauty.\n \
								<color is="#ffffff"><b>Skills:</b></color>\n \
								- Hold Left-Click: Hakuren - Cost 75 Reiryoku.\n \
								- Guard + F: Shunpo - Cost 1.5 Stamina, 10 Reiryoku
Shikai_Wabisuke.name = Shikai – Wabisuke
Shikai_Wabisuke.description = An elegantly curved sword whose treacherous nature is the opposite of its external refinement. Its strike places a curse of weight upon the target. With each parry or block, the victim's burden relentlessly doubles, \
								until the opponent is broken and pinned to the ground by their own unbearable load. Release command: <i><b>«Bend, Wabisuke»</b></i>.\n \
								<color is="#ffffff"><b>Skills:</b></color>\n \
								- 3rd Strike slows down target.\n \
								- Q: Crushing Regret - Cost 100% Signature Energy.\n \
								- Guard + F: Shunpo - Cost 1.5 Stamina, 10 Reiryoku
Shikai_Hozukimaru.name = Shikai – Hozukimaru
Shikai_Hozukimaru.description = A crude and straightforward war spear. Its simple, unadorned form conceals a fierce destructive power and unyielding durability. Within this weapon lies a dormant potential for transformation, capable of unlocking its true, even more formidable form.\n \
								<color is="#ffffff"><b>Skills:</b></color>\n \
								- Hold Left-Click: 3 Consecutive Thrusts.\n \
								- Hold Left-Click + Forward/Backward: Thrust\n \
								- Q: Tempest - Cost 100% Signature Energy.\n \
								- E: Windwhirl - Cost 100% Signature Energy.\n \
								- Guard + F: Shunpo - Cost 1.5 Stamina, 10 Reiryoku
Shikai_Kyoka_Suigetsu.name = Shikai – Kyoka Suigetsu
Shikai_Kyoka_Suigetsu.description = An unassuming katana, eternally in its released state. Its true power is not steel, but absolute sensory dominion. Those who witness its release ritual become forever trapped in its perfect hypnosis, \
									seeing a world sculpted by the wielder's will. A weapon that conquers reality through perception.\n\n<b><color is="#9D3356">Its true power lies dormant, waiting to be unleashed in a future update</color></b>
Shikai_Benihime.name = Shikai – Benihime
Shikai_Benihime.description = An elegant, slightly curved saber with a crimson motif. Upon its command, <i><b>«Awaken, Benihime»</b></i>, it gains the power to launch precise <i>Crimson Shots</i>, erect near-impenetrable hexagonal shields, and weave \
								razor-sharp nets of spiritual energy. A versatile blade perfect for both calculated offense and absolute defense.\n \
								<color is="#ffffff"><b>Skills:</b></color>\n \
								- Hold Left-Click: Benihime Beam - Cost 60 Reiryoku.\n \
								- Left-Click + Forward: Thrust.\n \
								- Guard + E: Crimson Seal: Mark an oponent and deal delayed damage after 3 seconds - Cost 65 Reiryoku.\n \
								- Guard + F: Shunpo - Cost 1.5 Stamina, 10 Reiryoku
True_Shikai_Zangetsu.name = True Shikai – Zangetsu
True_Shikai_Zangetsu.description = Ichigo's true Shikai, manifested as two distinct black blades. The massive cleaver embodies his fused Shinigami and Hollow powers, \
									while the smaller knife represents his Quincy heritage. Release command: <i><b>«Unite and Protect, Zangetsu»</b></i>. \
									The blades can fire\n<i>Getsuga Tensho</i> independently or combine them into a devastating cross-shaped wave, <i><b>Getsuga Jujisho</b></i>.\n\n<b><color is="#9D3356">Its true power lies dormant, waiting to be unleashed in a future update</color></b>
Shikai_Senbonzakura.name = Shikai - Senbonzakura
Shikai_Senbonzakura.description = A refined Zanpakuto that dissolves into countless blade-like petals upon command. With the command, <i><b>«Scatter, Senbonzakura»</b></i>, \
									the weapon transforms into a storm of shimmering fragments, each one as sharp as steel. These petals can be guided at will, overwhelming enemies through relentless,\
									precise strikes and turning the battlefield into a domain of elegant destruction.\n \
									<color is="#ffffff"><b>Skills:</b></color>\n \
									- Hold E: Arashi - Cost 20 Reiryoku per individual use.\n \
									- E + Forward/Backward: Ichisen - Cost 40 Reiryoku.\n \ 
									- Q: Shūen no Mai - Cost 100% Signature Energy.\n \
									- Guard + F: Shunpo - Cost 1.5 Stamina, 10 Reiryoku
									
## BANKAI ZANPAKUTO --------------------------
Bankai_Tensa_Zangetsu.name = Bankai – Tensa Zangetsu
Bankai_Tensa_Zangetsu.description = Bankai – Tensa Zangetsu is a legendary spiritual blade. Its black edge with a chain focuses the wielder’s energy, releasing the devastating wave <i><b>Getsuga Tensho — «Moon Fang That Pierces the Heavens»</b></i>. \n \
									<color is="#ffffff"><b>Skills:</b></color>\n \
									- Q (half-charge): Gestuga Tensho - Press Q again to chain a second Getsuga Tensho.\n \
									- Q (full-charge): Getsuga Tensho - Full Strength Getsuga Tensho, cost 100% signature charge.\n \
									- E: Kuro Shunpo - Cost 1.60 Stamina, 70 Reiryoku.\n \
									- R: Hollow Mask Transformation (Must Unlock First)\n \
									- Guard + F: Shunpo - Cost 1.5 Stamina, 10 Reiryoku
True_Bankai_Tensa_Zangetsu.name = True Bankai – Tensa Zangetsu
True_Bankai_Tensa_Zangetsu.description = The ultimate evolution of Ichigo's power. This form consolidates his dual blades into a single, immense black cleaver wrapped in stark white bandages. \
											It represents the full convergence of his spiritual heritage, focusing overwhelming force into a singular, devastating edge.\n\n<b><color is="#9D3356">Its true power lies dormant, waiting to be unleashed in a future update</color></b>
											
## QUINCY WEAPONS --------------------------
Kojaku_Bow.name = Quincy Bow - Kojaku
Kojaku_Bow.description = The basic bow usable by all Quincy. It is formed by gathering Reishi in the <i>Quincy Cross</i> on the right hand. The arrows it releases are also made of Reishi. It can destroy Hollows with long-range attacks. An early-game weapon for aspiring Quincy.\n \
						<color is="#ffffff"><b>Skills:</b></color>\n \
						- Right-Click: Hirenkyaku - Cost 30 Reiryoku.\n \
						- Q: Okami-Ya - Charge and shoot a powered-up arrow to your target - Cost 100% Signature Energy.

Four_Point_Quincy_Cross.name = 4-point Quincy Cross
Four_Point_Quincy_Cross.description = A four point quincy cross which helps Quincy players to manifest their abilities by granting MP while off-hand. Essential for sustaining your spiritual power.
Seele_Schneider.name = Seele Schneider
Seele_Schneider.description = A Quincy Weapon that may look like a sword, but functions more as a chainsaw. Reishi makes 3 million rounds per second around \
								the edge of the blade. This helps losing the bond between the Reishi and whatever it cuts. Although it looks and serves as a powerful blade \
								it can do much more damage as an arrow.


## ARMOUR --------------------------
Shihakusho_Kosode.name = Shihakusho - Kosode
Shihakusho_Kosode.description = The top of the standard Shinigami uniform worn by all members of the Gotei 13.
Shihakusho_Kosode_Lieutenant.name = Shihakusho - Kosode (Lieutenant)
Shihakusho_Kosode_Lieutenant.description = The upper-body garment of the standard <i>Shihakusho</i> with a Lieutenant badge which represents great prestige.
Shihakusho_Kosode_Sleeveless.name = Shihakusho - Kosode (Sleeveless) 
Shihakusho_Kosode_Sleeveless.description = A modified <i>Shihakusho</i> for those who desire more liberty of movement. More considered a cosmetic modification to the standard uniform.
Shinigami_Robes_Captain.name = Captain Shihakusho
Shinigami_Robes_Captain.description = The white coat worn by Captains over their standard uniform. Provides superior spiritual protection and denotes highest rank in the Gotei 13.
Shihakusho_Kosode_BareShoulder.name = Shihakusho - Kosode (Bare Shoulders)
Shihakusho_Kosode_BareShoulder.description = A modified <i>Shihakusho</i> that serves the same purpose as the Sleeveless variant while maintaining a more elegant and ceremonial appearance.
Shihakusho_Hakama.name = Shihakusho - Hakama
Shihakusho_Hakama.description = The lower-body garment that is included with the standard Shinigami uniform <i>Shihakusho</i>.

Hollow_Mask.name = Hollow Mask
Hollow_Mask.description = A manifestation of the power belonging to your inner Hollow.

Tensa_Zangetsu_Outfit.name = Mantle of the Heavenly Chain
Tensa_Zangetsu_Outfit.description = A sharp black mantle that born from thee chains of heaven. The one who wears it is said to be abe to slash the moon.

## INGREDIENTS --------------------------
Resonating_Reishi_Core.name = Resonating Reishi Core
Resonating_Reishi_Core.description = This core hums at a frequency that mimics yours. It's an extension of your soul. Ready to be assigned to a blade to awaken it.
Transcendent_Essence.name = Transcendent Essence
Transcendent_Essence.description = A swirling paradox of absolute power. The boundaries between your spirit and the physical world have dissolved into this singular pulsing point. Within this glow lies the true form of your soul, screaming to be released.
Hollow_Essence.name = Hollow Essence
Hollow_Essence.description = A crystallized remnant of a defeated Hollow’s distorted soul. It pulses with unstable reiryoku.
Inner_Hollow_Catalyst.name = Inner Hollow Catalyst
Inner_Hollow_Catalyst.description = Condensed remnants of Hollow essence, crystallized into a single orb. Upon consumption, something will awaken within you.
ReiryokuCrystal.name = Reiryoku Crystal
ReiryokuCrystal.description = A crystal of pure spiritual energy, a concentration of numerous souls. Awakens and evolves a Zanpakuto.
Soulweave_Cloth_Bolt.name = Soulweave Cloth Bolt
Soulweave_Cloth_Bolt.description = A bolt of black cloth infused with reishi which provides extra resistance.
Purified_Soulweave_Cloth_Bolt.name = Purified Soulweave Cloth Bolt
Purified_Soulweave_Cloth_Bolt.description = A pure bolt of white cloth infused with high quality reishi.
Corrupted_Life_Essence.name = Corrupted Life Essence
Corrupted_Life_Essence.description = <i>For some reason, this reishi formed-crystal usually found in plants on Orbis is was in this Hollow. \
										Although it appears corrupted, and the reishi concentration is lower. With enough of these, maybe you can \
										convert them into Life Essence.</i>

## SPIRIT FRAGMENTS --------------------------
Sode_no_Shirayuki_Spirit_Fragment.name = Spirit Fragment - Sode no Shirayuki
Sode_no_Shirayuki_Spirit_Fragment.description = A cold fragment of pure spiritual energy.\n<b>Right-Click to consume (unlock Shikai)</b>
Wabisuke_Spirit_Fragment.name = Spirit Fragment - Wabisuke
Wabisuke_Spirit_Fragment.description = A heavy fragment containing the burdened spirit of Wabisuke. Its presence weighs upon the soul.\n<b>Right-Click to consume (unlock Shikai)</b>
Benihime_Spirit_Fragment.name = Spirit Fragment - Benihime
Benihime_Spirit_Fragment.description = A crimson spirit fragment carrying a quiet but deadly elegance.\n<b>Right-Click to consume (unlock Shikai)</b>
Hozukimaru_Spirit_Fragment.name = Spirit Fragment - Hozukimaru
Hozukimaru_Spirit_Fragment.description = A fragment brimming with battle spirit.\n<b>Right-Click to consume (unlock Shikai)</b>
Senbonzakura_Spirit_Fragment.name = Spirit Fragment - Senbonzakura
Senbonzakura_Spirit_Fragment.description = A light but brimming fragment of a Sakura petal. You can notice a deadly aura.\n<b>Right-Click to consume (unlock Shikai)</b>
Zangetsu_Spirit_Fragment.name = Spirit Fragment - Zangetsu
Zangetsu_Spirit_Fragment.description = A fragment containing a wild amount of energy. It appears to be very unstable. \n<b>Right-Click to consume (unlock Shikai)</b>
Tensa_Zangetsu_Spirit_Fragment.name = Spirit Fragment - Tensa Zangetsu
Tensa_Zangetsu_Spirit_Fragment.description = A fragment that has an insane amount of condensed energy. You can feel the ultimate power in your hands. \n<b>Right-Click to consume (unlock Bankai, Tensa Zangetsu)</b>

## CRAFTING BENCHES --------------------------
Soul_Imprinting_Altar.name = Soul Imprinting Altar
Soul_Imprinting_Altar.description = A sacred workstation where the wielder's soul merges with the Asauchi. Through deep meditation and concentration of spiritual energy (Reiryoku), the foundation of the future Zanpakuto is laid. \								This altar is used not only for the initial awakening but also for the subsequent stages of the blade's evolution — from Shikai to the ultimate revelation, Bankai.
Soulweave_Loom.name = Soulweave Loom
Soulweave_Loom.description = A loom which is used to weave clothes infused with spiritual matter. Variations of it are widely used across the Soul Society and other places.



## MISC ITEMS --------------------------
items.Currency_Kan.name = Kan
items.Currency_Kan.description = The standard currency of the Soul Society. A single Kan represents the value of one bale of rice in the world of the living. Its weight and ring are said to be tuned to the very frequency of reishi, making it impossible to counterfeit.\
								To a merchant in the Rukongai, this coin is a fortune; to a captain, mere pocket change.

items.Medical_Pill_Basic.name = Basic Medical Pill
items.Medical_Pill_Basic.description = A standard-issue pill from Squad 4's medical corps. Made from concentrated medicinal herbs and a trace of healing kaido energy.\n\nRestores <color is="#ffffff">30%</color> health instantly.

items.Kaido_Infused_Pill.name = Kaido-Infused Restoration Pill
items.Kaido_Infused_Pill.description = A masterpiece of Squad 4's medical research. Not merely a pill, but a solid capsule of suspended healing kaido spells.\n\nRestores <color is="#ffffff">100%</color> health instantly and grants:\	
										\n\n• <color is="#ffffff">Health Regen II</color>\n\nDuration: <color is="#ffffff">0:30</color>

items.Race_Selection_Menu.name = Race Selection Menu
items.Race_Selection_Menu.description = <b><color is="#ffffff">Right-Click</color></b> to open the race selection menu.\n \
										<i>This item will be deleted after its use </i>